        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 “Ai nang ta ’muc lak, ’patlou lak ge” twmei",
            "Latryan gaymei nai e, lungh ryanra lak ge,",
            "Nzaengcdic khou zingbangc hei zingc bam sihni,",
            "Mi paengc thangc kalaanv dic gaanc suangmei dic nai.",
            "",
            "“Ai nang ta ’muc lak, ’patlou lak ge,",
            "Abaanc !}2 zaylou ni,nang ta pamclou puni,",
            "Ai nang ta ’muc lak, ’patlou lak ge,",
            "Thuakloumei pu Ai !}2 kadanlou puni.”",
            "",
            "2 Jisu khou aramthuanku tukumh lyan ni,",
            "Kamei zianloumei lev kadanloumei khang?",
            "Meic baihmei nunc khou Karingcbamv lam dinc ni,",
            "Kaniw nic Jisu ta thayna lwmlou khang.",
            "",
            "3 “Ai nang ta ’muc lak,” mi latryan hei lwmna",
            "Neihlaapui lu suanna hu thangc tat gut ni;",
            "Dih lev pam-rai guay ata karaeng sihni",
            "Jisu adaeng tuancna tiineihlaalou ni.",
            "",
            "4 Kandih khou atuang ryanra guay hei luaina",
            "Kachaekc rangcmun khou ai guang ding tangc pwkhou,",
            "“Latpiu chuymei bangc, kailungc khou nang gut tho,\"",
            "Hei latkaeng chu pwkhou adih neihlaa ni."
          ]
        }
